Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:56:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 032/144] =?UTF-8?q?GreatDANE:=20about:preferences=20rebran?=
 =?UTF-8?q?d=20via=20overrides=20=E2=80=94=20Dane=20sidebar=20mark,=20gene?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ric=20account=20avatar,=20sad-dane=20illustration;=20hide=20Rel?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ay=20email-mask=20checkbox=20(test=20widened)?=
